## VK Video 1.163 (51920) — runtime ad removal revision 2

This revision is built over the verified project-signed 1.163.1 APK and targets the two remaining ad paths reproduced after that release.

New in this revision:
- filters server-provided VK Clips StaticAd, MarketAd, FloatingAd and MyTarget feed items before ClipsRecomResponseAdapter can render them;
- therefore blocks app-install / action CTA cards produced from appPackageName and appDeeplink;
- blocks the runtime MIDROLL gate before VideoAutoPlay pauses or switches the main video player into InstreamAdEngine.

Existing 1.163.1 ad hardening and compatibility patches remain in place.

Verification:
- both new Morphe delta patches applied with no failed patches;
- manifest coexistence gate passed;
- ARM64 native signature bypass pattern passed;
- DEX application-class gate passed;
- package remains com.vk.vkvideo, Android version remains 1.163 / 51920;
- APK is zip-aligned and signed with the same project certificate using APK Signature Scheme v3 only.

Build provenance is included in delta-build-metadata.json.
